menu "Caipo touch sensor (TTP223)"

    config CAIPO_TOUCH_POLL_MS
        int "Polling interval (ms)"
        range 10 200
        default 50
        help
            How often the driver task samples the TTP223 output.
            Doc FLD-1 recommends 50 ms.

    config CAIPO_TOUCH_DEBOUNCE_MS
        int "Debounce time (ms)"
        range 0 200
        default 20
        help
            The debounced level flips only after the new level has been seen
            for this long (at least 2 consecutive polls regardless).

    config CAIPO_TOUCH_LONGPRESS_MS
        int "Long-press threshold (ms)"
        range 300 10000
        default 2000
        help
            Hold duration that fires TOUCH_EVENT_LONG_PRESS (while still held).
            Doc FLD-1 specifies 2 s.

    config CAIPO_TOUCH_DOUBLETAP_WINDOW_MS
        int "Double-tap window (ms)"
        range 100 1000
        default 300
        help
            A second press starting within this window after a release fires
            TOUCH_EVENT_DOUBLE_TAP. Also the delay before a lone TAP is
            confirmed.

    config CAIPO_TOUCH_STARTUP_BLANK_MS
        int "Startup blanking (ms)"
        range 0 5000
        default 500
        help
            The TTP223 self-calibrates after power-up and its output is
            undefined; events are suppressed until this time since boot.

endmenu
